{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Getting the Client", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Time-Out ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 9, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Closing a Business Deal", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "In a business negotiation, it is important to know when and how to complete a transaction or negotiation. You need to make sure the other party understands your terms and any other actions that need to be taken.<br/><br/>Here is some language you can use to ensure you can close a deal.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ol><li>Talking about things you agreed on <span class=\"italic\"><br/>We've <span class=\"underline\">settled on</span> more than what we expected. <br/>We've <span class=\"underline\">agreed to</span> purchasing a new tracking system. <br/>As we <span class=\"underline\">agreed</span>, we'll be taking care of the training. </span> </li><br/><li>Talking about things that need to be decided <span class=\"italic\"><br/>He <span class=\"underline\">seems</span> pretty eager to get the partnership going. <br/>He <span class=\"underline\">seems</span> ready to close the deal. <br/><span class=\"underline\">Wouldn't now be the time to</span> mention our current staff member working in South America? <br/>I am ready to <span class=\"underline\">sign off on</span> the agreement. <br/>Sure. Go ahead and <span class=\"underline\">sign to</span> what we've decided. </span> </li><br/><li>Talking about things that need to be arranged (future \tmeeting) <span class=\"italic\"><br/>We'll be arranging a meeting for that. <br/>We need to arrange a follow-up meeting to discuss that. </span> </li><br/><li>Emphasizing the benefits <span class=\"italic\"><br/>We want to ensure that you feel this is the right choice for your company. <br/>All in all, you've got yourself a great deal. </span> </li></ol>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Future with Present Continuous and Will", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are many different ways in which you can express the future in English. Here's how to use the Present Continuous and \u201cwill\u201d.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Use the Present Continuous to talk about future plans. <span class=\"italic\"><br/><br/>We are arranging a meeting in the future<br/>We are settling on a final price.<br/>We are agreeing to system that will help us track our inventory.</span></li><br/><li>Use \u201cwill\u201d to talk about a voluntary action. We normally do this when we respond to someone's offers or offer to do something for someone else.<span class=\"italic\"><br/><br/>You'll need to send me a copy of that document. <br/>We will need to make arrangements.<br/>This will help her to know that we are likely to be successful.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "private office", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an office that only one person or group may use", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm calling you from a private office.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you may hear when closing a deal.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "impending", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an event or situation (usually unpleasant) that will soon happen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He mentioned some impending discussion with his personnel team.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ahead of the game", "type": "name"}, {"content": "being early; having done more research than competitors so far", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It will help him to know that we're already ahead of the game.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to come straight out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to tell something directly without hiding one's plans, feelings or important facts", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: However, he's not coming straight out regarding his training needs.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "dual", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having two similar aspects or functions", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Won't now be the time to mention Ferdinand's role with the dual staging of the main PR events in North and South America?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Read the following roles and act out a dialogue. <br/> <br/><span class=\"strong\">Role 1:</span><br/>You are about to close a negotiation to deliver training for a company. Your co-worker wants to talk to you before you seal the deal. He has questions and doubts. Make sure you clarify and explain the deal focusing on:<br/> <ul> <li>things you agreed on</li> <li>things that need to be discussed and arranged</li> </ul>Finally, emphasize the benefits of the transaction. <br/> <br/><span class=\"strong\">Role 2:</span><br/>Your co-worker is about to close a very important negotiation to deliver training for a big multinational company. You have many questions you want to ask them before they close the deal.<br/> Brainstorm a list of questions and be prepared to ask them.<br/> Finally, give your co-worker permission to close the deal.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I clarify and explain the agreements of a deal.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I clarify details which still need to be arranged.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I emphasize a deal's benefits.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask to clarify details before closing a deal.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can plan steps necessary for future action.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can negotiate a deal.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about jobs and work. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " When do you know a negotiation is over?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How do you emphasize the benefits of the deal?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "How will we continue negotiations?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Is Miranda ready to close the deal? Will Farmani <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">sign off</span> on it?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}, {"content": [{"content": "To <span class=\"italic\">\u201csign off\u201d</span> means to approve something with a signature.", "type": "text", "tip_id": 0}], "type": "tips"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to watch the video.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "STI", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "What does she say?", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "Miranda is calling from a private office.", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Miranda is arranging a meeting with Janet and Farmani.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": 0}, {"id": 2, "_data": [{"content": "Farmani isn't coming straight out about his training needs.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": true}, {"id": 3, "_data": [{"content": "Farmani mentioned some impending discussion.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": true}, {"id": 4, "_data": [{"content": "Miranda is going to mention the dual staging of the PR events in North and South America. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": true}, {"id": 5, "_data": [{"content": "Far