, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Hi Janet. I'm calling you from a private office at Farmani's here.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Good to hear from you. How are things going?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Very good. We are settling on eight million.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Great. I knew you could do it.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: We're also agreeing to the inventory-tracking system.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Hmmm, how does he come across?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: He seems pretty eager to get this going. However, he's not coming straight out regarding his training needs. We are arranging a future meeting for that.  But he seems ready to sign off on our agreements so far. I'd like to go ahead.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: What seems to be the issue regarding training?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I'm not sure. But he mentioned some impending discussion with his personnel team.", "id": 2, "time": "22000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Go ahead and sign to what you've agreed on. He'll have to send me a copy. Won't now be the time to mention Ferdinand's role with the dual staging of the main PR events in North and South America?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Yes! Great closer. We will need to arrange that.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Yes. We want to ensure that he feels he made the right partnership choice. It will help him to know that we're already ahead of the game.", "id": 3, "time": "47000", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn7le09ob10re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}]}]}